  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- **The TessageBus senders and publishers take a `CancellationToken`, last and defaulted:** `SendAsync` on `IUnitOfWorkTommandSender` and `IIndependentTommandSender`, and `PublishAsync` on `IUnitOfWorkTeventPublisher` and `IIndependentTeventPublisher`. The handlers a send or a publish runs in the caller's execution are handed it, and cancelling it fails the send or publish with an `OperationCanceledException`, rolling back its unit of work. A class of a consumer's own that implements one of them must take the token.\n- **Requires newer minor versions of other Compze packages:** Compze.Internals.SystemCE 0.14.0-internal (was 0.13.0-internal). Upgrading to this version upgrades each package listed here too, so their changelogs apply to this upgrade as well.",
